sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: A straight line commensurable with a major straight line is itself also major.
----
proof:

Let {AB} be major, and let {CD} be commensurable with {AB}.

I say that {CD} is major.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="250" height="95" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.68 diagram" src="propX68.gif"/></noscript>
